<title>USA: Metris Cos declares first dividend.</title>
<headline>Metris Cos declares first dividend.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-04-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Metris Cos Inc said Wednesday its board of directors declared the company's first quarterly dividend, a payout of $0.01 per common share.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable on May 15 to shareholders of record at the close of business on May 13.</p>
<p>Metris is a direct marketer of consumer credit products.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
